    },
    "That file is not a Yomidori collection." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "このファイルはヨミドリのコレクションではありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The camera button takes a new page." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "カメラのボタンで次のページを撮れます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The camera is busy elsewhere for the moment." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "カメラはいま別のところで使われています。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The dictionary's, until you change them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "変えるまでは辞書のとおりです。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The line runs over the high morae and falls where the accent does; the number is the mora after which it falls, 0 when it never does. Tokyo accent, from Kanjium." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "線は高い拍の上を通り、アクセントの位置で下がります。数字は何拍目のあとで下がるかで、0は下がらないことを表します。東京式アクセント、Kanjiumのデータによる。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The number of questions due, kept up to date while the app is closed. Only the number: no banners, no sounds." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "期日の来た問題の数を、アプリを閉じていても更新します。数だけで、バナーも音もありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The picture, or its text as read (⌘↩)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "写真か、読み取った本文か（⌘↩）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The ranks of each question are kept apart from now on; the chart fills in over the days." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "問いごとのランクは今日から記録します。日を追ってグラフが埋まっていきます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The share of reviews you should get right when a word comes up. At 95 % each word comes back about twice as often as at 90 %. Counts from the next answer, on this device." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "復習で正解できる割合の目安です。95 % にすると、それぞれの言葉が 90 % のときの約二倍の頻度で出てきます。次の回答から、この端末に反映されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The word as the dictionary has it" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "辞書の形"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The words and the sentences they were met in, for another reader to start fresh; no photos, no cover, no reviews." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "言葉と、出会った文だけを渡します。受け取った人は一から学べます。写真、表紙、復習の記録は含みません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The words on the cover are read, so the name can be picked, not typed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "表紙の文字を読み取るので、名前は入力せず選べます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The words themselves stay in the dictionary; only the list of what you looked up goes." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "言葉そのものは辞書に残ります。消えるのは、調べた言葉の一覧だけです。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The zoom and the page buttons stand in one column on this side of the picture, the zoom nearest your thumb: the side of the hand that holds the iPad." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ズームとページのボタンを、写真のこちら側に一列に並べます。ズームは親指に一番近い所に。iPadを持つ手の側を選んでください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The zoom and the page buttons stand in one column on this side of the picture, the zoom nearest your thumb: the side of the hand that holds the phone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ズームとページのボタンを、写真のこちら側に一列に並べます。ズームは親指に一番近い所に。端末を持つ手の側を選んでください。"
          }
        }
      }
